Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 18:36:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] local-provider: skip login and set up a local model provider

The login screen and the sign-in-in-progress screens offer "s  skip login
(local model)". Skipping opens a setup modal (also `/local-provider`) for
Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp, vLLM, or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint, with
model auto-detection from {base_url}/models.

Saving writes [model.<key>] with its own api_key plus [models].default (and
session_summary when unset) to ~/.grok/config.toml (0600), hot-reloads the
agent's models, and authenticates with xai.api_key, which the agent already
accepts when a model carries its own credential. Later launches skip the
login screen.

Gork-Patch-Id: local-provider
Gork-Invariant: local-provider-login-skip
Gork-Risk: medium

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
