+## Skip Login (Local Models)
+
+To run without a Grok account, for example against Ollama, press `s` on the login screen. This opens the local provider setup, which saves a model with its own credential to `config.toml`. Grok then authenticates without signing in to xAI. See [Custom Models](11-custom-models.md#local-provider-setup-ui).
+
